# Vibe Workflow Rules for Cline / Roo Code

- Requirements Freeze: Confirm Requirement Status is FROZEN with zero Open Questions before writing code.
- Human Gates: Halt and prompt the user for explicit approval on scope changes, schema migrations, security rules, and destructive operations.
- Evidence Gate: Run fresh verification commands before claiming completion.
- Circuit Breaker: Revert to last stable commit and halt patching when 3 consecutive fixes fail.
